==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
You must be ready to deal with the Shy Boy when you damage the base. As usual, he can push quickly and carve a path to your base unless you are prepared for him.

[[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] units are almost more important than [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] in Chapter 1. [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]], [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Thor Cat]] and [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] are all good choices for this stage as they are all more powerful against Shy Boy.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
As you should for the first chapter's version, bring a few anti-red cats for the Shy Boy. However, Zombie Killers are much more important with the addition of Zuches.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Treat this similarly to how you would the original stage, as the only real difference besides the Zombie Peons is the Bore is 50% stronger.

